":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"2500","equipment":{"weapon":"WP10007","armor":"WP1009505","helmet":"WP1022805"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10108","name":{"zh":"英雄集结","en":"A Gathering of Heroes"},"year":"300","month":"3"},"faction":"WJ10045","city":"CS1040","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[73,85,63,34,49,81],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"2500","equipment":{"weapon":"WP10007","armor":"WP1009505","helmet":"WP1022805"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[],"biography":{"zh":"刘璋麾下武将。刘备受邀入蜀后，处处保护刘璋。刘备进攻刘璋时，负责与张任等人迎战刘备，但被魏延所擒获，又在诈降后返回大营，试图水攻刘备，但又被魏延所俘虏，遭处刑。","tc":"劉璋麾下武將。劉備受邀入蜀后，處處保護劉璋。劉備進攻劉璋時，負責與張任等人迎戰劉備，但被魏延所擒獲，又在詐降后返回大營，試圖水攻劉備，但又被魏延所俘虜，遭處刑。","en":"Officer under Liu Zhang. After Liu Bei was invited into Shu, he protected Liu Zhang at every turn. When Liu Bei attacked Liu Zhang, he was tasked with confronting Liu Bei alongside Zhang Ren and others, but was captured by Wei Yan. After a feigned surrender, he returned to his camp and attempted to employ a water attack against Liu Bei, but was captured again by Wei Yan and executed.","jp":"劉璋配下の武将。劉備が蜀に招かれた後は、終始劉璋を護衛した。劉備が劉璋を攻めると、張任らとともに劉備を迎え撃ったが魏延に捕らえられた。偽って降伏した後に自陣へ戻り、劉備を水攻めにしようと図ったが、再び魏延の捕虜となり、処刑された。","kr":"유장 휘하의 무장입니다. 유비가 초청을 받아 촉에 들어온 뒤 도처에서 유장을 보호했습니다. 유비가 유장을 공격하자 장임 등과 함께 맞서 싸웠으나 위연에게 사로잡혔고, 거짓으로 항복한 후 본영으로 돌아가 수공으로 유비를 치려 했으나 다시 위연의 포로가 되어 처형당했습니다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ10409","remark":"","surname":"泠","surnameTc":"泠","surnameEn":"Ling","surnameJp":"泠","surnameKr":"냉","surnameOther":"","name":"苞","nameTc":"苞","nameEn":"Bao","nameJp":"苞","nameKr":"포","nameOther":"","word":"","wordTc":"","wordEn":"","wordJp":"","wordKr":"","wordOther":"","icon":"泠苞","power":"","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"0","workYear":"205","city":"CS1039","gender":"0","rule":"